1
00:00:02,795 --> 00:00:05,088
WE'VE GOT THREE MINUTES
TILL THE REACTOR BLOWS.

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,507
WE'RE NEVER
GOING TO MAKE IT.

3
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:08,676
YOU'VE GOT TO GET
OUT OF HERE!

4
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:09,802
SAVE YOURSELF.

5
00:00:11,637 --> 00:00:12,930
NO, I WON'T LEAVE YOU.

6
00:00:12,972 --> 00:00:14,974
DON'T WORRY ABOUT ME.

7
00:00:15,014 --> 00:00:16,183
I'M A ROBOT.

8
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:18,059
I'M JUST A MACHINE!

9
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:20,270
NO, YOU'RE NOT.

10
00:00:20,312 --> 00:00:21,772
NOT TO ME.

11
00:00:21,814 --> 00:00:22,898
OH, MY GOD.

12
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:23,941
WHAT?

13
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:26,610
I AM EXTREMELY TALENTED.

14
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:28,278
YEAH, YEAH, YOU'RE GREAT.

15
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,113
OKAY, LET'S TAKE IT FROM...

16
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:33,116
NO, I MEAN I WAS REALLY
ACTING MY ASS OFF.

17
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:36,036
WELL, I THOUGHT
I WAS PRETTY GOOD, TOO.

18
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:37,913
OH, YEAH, YOU'RE SOLID.

19
00:00:37,955 --> 00:00:39,623
YOU'RE JUST NO... ME.

20
00:00:39,665 --> 00:00:42,877
YOU KNOW WHAT? I THINK
THAT'S ENOUGH FOR NOW.

21
00:00:42,918 --> 00:00:45,337
I DON'T WANT TO BE
OVER-REHEARSED.

22
00:00:45,379 --> 00:00:48,173
FINE! I'LL DO IT WITHOUT YOU!

23
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:51,802
I DON'T NEED YOU
OR ANYBODY ELSE!

24
00:00:51,844 --> 00:00:54,346
I'M GOING TO MAKE IT
ON MY OWN!

25
00:00:55,514 --> 00:00:57,224
YOU'LL SEE!

26
00:00:57,265 --> 00:00:58,475
YOU'LL ALL SEE!

27
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:10,487
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

28
00:01:10,529 --> 00:01:12,781
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

29
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:15,993
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

30
00:01:16,035 --> 00:01:20,080
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

31
00:01:20,121 --> 00:01:22,541
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN
YOUR DAY, YOUR WEEK ♪

32
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:25,753
♪ YOUR MONTH,
OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

33
00:01:25,794 --> 00:01:29,048
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

34
00:01:29,088 --> 00:01:32,384
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

35
00:01:39,934 --> 00:01:42,770
SO, WHAT'S THIS THING
YOU'RE AUDITIONING FOR?

36
00:01:42,811 --> 00:01:44,605
OH, IT'S A NEW TV SHOW.

37
00:01:44,646 --> 00:01:46,398
I'M UP FOR THE PART
OF MAC MACKAVELLI...

38
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,733
OR "MAC."

39
00:01:47,775 --> 00:01:49,150
REALLY?

40
00:01:49,192 --> 00:01:50,360
YEAH.

41
00:01:50,402 --> 00:01:52,613
I'M A DETECTIVE
AND I SOLVE CRIMES

42
00:01:52,654 --> 00:01:55,074
WITH THE HELP
OF MY ROBOT PARTNER.

43
00:01:55,115 --> 00:01:57,200
HE'S A COMPUTERIZED HUMANOID

44
00:01:57,242 --> 00:02:00,119
ELECTRONICALLY ENHANCED
SECRET ENFORCER.

45
00:02:00,161 --> 00:02:02,831
OR "CHEESE."

46
00:02:02,873 --> 00:02:06,418
SO, MAC AND CHEESE.

47
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,378
THAT'S THE TITLE.

48
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,922
YEAH.

49
00:02:09,964 --> 00:02:11,381
YOU KNOW, THEY REALLY LUCKED OUT

50
00:02:11,423 --> 00:02:12,841
THAT THE INITIALS SPELL
"CHEESE."

51
00:02:12,883 --> 00:02:15,469
THAT IS LUCKY.

52
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:16,720
HUH.

53
00:02:16,762 --> 00:02:18,305
SO, JOEY,
IF YOU GET THIS

54
00:02:18,346 --> 00:02:21,391
YOU'RE GOING TO BE, LIKE,
THE STAR OF YOUR OWN TV SHOW.

55
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:23,727
I MEAN, YOU'LL BE
LIKE THE BIG CHEESE.

56
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:24,728
OR THE BIG MAC.

57
00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:26,063
HEY, YOU LOVE THOSE.

58
00:02:26,105 --> 00:02:27,397
WELL, DON'T GET
YOUR HOPES UP

59
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:29,483
BECAUSE IT'S PROBABLY
NOT GOING TO HAPPEN.

60
00:02:29,524 --> 00:02:31,485
NOW, NOW, WHY WOULD
YOU SAY THAT, JOSEPH?

61
00:02:31,526 --> 00:02:32,569
COME ON,
YOU GUYS.

62
00:02:32,611 --> 00:02:33,946
MY OWN TV SHOW?

63
00:02:33,988 --> 00:02:35,739
I JUST... I DON'T KNOW
IF I'M GOOD ENOUGH.

64
00:02:35,781 --> 00:02:37,908
I AM.

65
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:39,326
Rachel:
WELL, JOEY

66
00:02:39,367 --> 00:02:40,577
WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

67
00:02:40,619 --> 00:02:41,703
YOU'RE A TERRIFIC ACTOR.

68
00:02:41,745 --> 00:02:43,580
YOU REALLY THINK SO?

69
00:02:43,622 --> 00:02:45,540
HOW CAN YOU EVEN
ASK THAT QUESTION?

70
00:02:47,126 --> 00:02:48,251
WHOA,
SHE'S PRETTY.

71
00:02:48,293 --> 00:02:49,503
YEAH.

72
00:02:49,544 --> 00:02:52,006
OH, AND SHE'S REALLY NICE, TOO.

73
00:02:52,047 --> 00:02:53,882
SHE TAUGHT ME ALL ABOUT,
YOU KNOW

74
00:02:53,924 --> 00:02:55,509
HOW TO WORK WITH THE CAMERAS

75
00:02:55,550 --> 00:02:57,136
AND "SMELL THE FART" ACTING.

76
00:02:57,176 --> 00:02:58,137
HUH.

77
00:02:58,177 --> 00:02:59,220
I'M SORRY...

78
00:02:59,262 --> 00:03:01,222
WHAT?
EXCUSE ME?

79
00:03:01,264 --> 00:03:03,350
IT'S LIKE, YOU
GOT SO MANY LINES

80
00:03:03,391 --> 00:03:04,476
TO LEARN SO FAST

81
00:03:04,518 --> 00:03:06,603
THAT SOMETIMES
YOU NEED A MINUTE

82
00:03:06,645 --> 00:03:08,313
TO REMEMBER
YOUR NEXT ONE.

83
00:03:08,355 --> 00:03:10,273
SO, WHILE YOU'RE
THINKING OF IT

84
00:03:10,315 --> 00:03:13,986
YOU TAKE THIS BIG PAUSE,
WHERE YOU LOOK ALL INTENSE

85
00:03:14,028 --> 00:03:15,236
YOU KNOW, LIKE THIS.

86
00:03:16,655 --> 00:03:19,158
OKAY.
MMM.
OH.

87
00:03:19,198 --> 00:03:20,492
( rattling )

88
00:03:20,534 --> 00:03:23,162
OH, HERE'S MY SCENE!
HERE'S MY SCENE!

89
00:03:23,202 --> 00:03:24,203
Mrs. Wallace?

90
00:03:24,245 --> 00:03:25,413
I'm Dr. Drake Ramoray

91
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:26,999
your sister's neurosurgeon.

92
00:03:27,041 --> 00:03:30,209
Your sister is suffering
from a...

93
00:03:33,839 --> 00:03:36,341
( with heavy accent ):
YEAH, EVA...

94
00:03:36,383 --> 00:03:40,179
WE'VE DONE SOME
EXCELLENT WORK HERE

95
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:43,222
AND I WOULD HAVE TO SAY

96
00:03:43,264 --> 00:03:47,061
YOUR PROBLEM IS QUITE CLEAR.

97
00:03:47,102 --> 00:03:49,228
( piano plays )

98
00:03:49,270 --> 00:03:52,524
♪ ALL YOU WANT IS A DINKLE ♪

99
00:03:52,566 --> 00:03:55,652
♪ WHAT YOU ENVY IS A SCHWANG ♪

100
00:03:55,694 --> 00:03:59,198
♪ WHAT THING THROUGH WHICH
YOU CAN TINKLE ♪

101
00:03:59,238 --> 00:04:02,242
♪ OR PLAY WITH
OR SIMPLY LET HANG. ♪

102
00:04:02,283 --> 00:04:04,870
I PLAY AL PACINO'S BUTT.

103
00:04:06,872 --> 00:04:08,207
ALL RIGHT?

104
00:04:08,248 --> 00:04:12,002
HE GOES INTO THE SHOWER
AND THEN I'M HIS BUTT.

105
00:04:12,044 --> 00:04:13,503
OH, MY GOD.

106
00:04:13,545 --> 00:04:15,005
COME ON, YOU GUYS.

107
00:04:15,047 --> 00:04:17,091
THIS IS A REAL MOVIE,
AND AL PACINO'S IN IT

108
00:04:17,132 --> 00:04:18,217
AND THAT'S BIG.

109
00:04:18,257 --> 00:04:19,718
OH, NO, IT'S TERRIFIC.

110
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,969
YOU DESERVE THIS.

111
00:04:21,011 --> 00:04:22,554
AFTER ALL YOUR YEARS

112
00:04:22,596 --> 00:04:24,639
OF STRUGGLING, YOU'VE FINALLY
BEEN ABLE TO CRACK

113
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:26,683
YOUR WAY INTO
SHOW BUSINESS.

114
00:04:28,602 --> 00:04:30,311
OKAY, FINE. MAKE JOKES.

115
00:04:30,353 --> 00:04:31,396
I DON'T CARE.

116
00:04:31,438 --> 00:04:33,272
THIS IS A BIG BREAK FOR ME.

117
00:04:33,314 --> 00:04:34,816
YOU'RE RIGHT. IT IS.

118
00:04:35,817 --> 00:04:38,570
SO, YOU GOING TO INVITE
US ALL TO THE BIG OPENING?

119
00:04:40,072 --> 00:04:41,698
ALL RIGHT, WELL,
I'M OUT OF HERE.

120
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:42,741
WISH ME LUCK.

121
00:04:42,783 --> 00:04:44,868
♪ GOOD LUCK, GOOD LUCK ♪

122
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:48,163
♪ WE ALL WISH YOU GOOD LUCK. ♪

123
00:04:50,624 --> 00:04:52,167
YEAH, WHATEVER.

124
00:04:57,589 --> 00:04:59,633
IT'S YOUR TURN.

125
00:04:59,674 --> 00:05:01,885
OH, ARE WE PLAYING THIS?

126
00:05:01,927 --> 00:05:04,221
HEY.

127
00:05:04,263 --> 00:05:06,389
HEY. HOW'D THE
AUDITION GO?

128
00:05:06,431 --> 00:05:07,432
TERRIBLE.

129
00:05:07,474 --> 00:05:08,600
I MESSED UP EVERY LINE.

130
00:05:08,642 --> 00:05:10,102
I SHOULDN'T EVEN
BE AN ACTOR.

131
00:05:10,144 --> 00:05:11,603
WAIT A MINUTE.

132
00:05:11,645 --> 00:05:12,771
ARE YOU DOING THAT THING

133
00:05:12,813 --> 00:05:14,313
WHERE YOU PRETEND
IT DIDN'T GO WELL

134
00:05:14,355 --> 00:05:15,523
BUT IT REALLY
DID GO WELL?

135
00:05:15,565 --> 00:05:18,152
YEAH. DID I FOOL YOU?

136
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,320
TOTALLY.

137
00:05:20,361 --> 00:05:22,614
SO IT DID GO WELL.

138
00:05:22,656 --> 00:05:24,532
IT WENT AMAZINGLY WELL.

139
00:05:24,574 --> 00:05:25,826
THAT'S GREAT.
GREAT.

140
00:05:25,867 --> 00:05:28,162
YEAH. IT'S DOWN TO ME
AND TWO OTHER GUYS.

141
00:05:28,203 --> 00:05:30,164
I KNOW BOTH OF THEM
AND THEY'RE REALLY GOOD.

142
00:05:30,205 --> 00:05:32,624
ONE OF THEM IS THE GUY
FROM THOSE ALLERGY COMMERCIALS

143
00:05:32,666 --> 00:05:34,501
WHO'S ALWAYS GETTING CHASED
BY THOSE BIG FLOWERS.

144
00:05:34,542 --> 00:05:37,336
OH, I LOVE THAT GUY.

145
00:05:37,378 --> 00:05:39,338
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

146
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:42,176
WHAT AM I DOING?

147
00:05:42,217 --> 00:05:43,677
I'M SO NERVOUS, YOU KNOW.

148
00:05:43,718 --> 00:05:46,345
THE CALLBACK ISN'T UNTIL
TOMORROW AT 5:00.

149
00:05:46,387 --> 00:05:48,723
I FEEL LIKE MY HEAD'S
GOING TO EXPLODE.

150
00:05:48,765 --> 00:05:50,600
WELL, IT IS OVERDUE.

151
00:05:51,893 --> 00:05:53,352
LOOK, DON'T WORRY, OKAY?

152
00:05:53,394 --> 00:05:54,813
YOU'RE GOING
TO BE FINE.

153
00:05:54,855 --> 00:05:56,564
THERE'S JUST SO MUCH PRESSURE.

154
00:05:56,606 --> 00:05:58,817
NO OFFENSE, BUT WHAT YOU GUYS
ALL DO IS VERY DIFFERENT.

155
00:05:58,859 --> 00:06:00,359
I DON'T KNOW
IF YOU'D UNDERSTAND.

156
00:06:00,401 --> 00:06:02,029
YEAH, NONE OF
THE REST OF US

157
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:04,323
HAVE TO DEAL WITH
PRESSURE AT OUR JOBS.

158
00:06:04,363 --> 00:06:06,783
YES, FRAN, I KNOW
WHAT TIME IT IS

159
00:06:06,825 --> 00:06:10,411
BUT I'M LOOKING AT THE WEENUS
AND I'M NOT HAPPY.

160
00:06:10,453 --> 00:06:12,914
WELL, I'M TEARING
THE LETTUCE.

161
00:06:12,956 --> 00:06:14,666
UH-HUH. IS IT DIRTY?

162
00:06:14,708 --> 00:06:16,335
NO, DON'T WORRY,
I'M GOING TO WASH IT.

163
00:06:16,375 --> 00:06:19,171
DON'T. I LIKE IT DIRTY.

164
00:06:20,797 --> 00:06:23,091
THAT'S YOUR CALL.

165
00:06:23,133 --> 00:06:26,220
SO, UH... WHAT ARE YOU
GOING TO DO NEXT?

166
00:06:26,261 --> 00:06:29,097
WELL, I THOUGHT THAT
I WOULD CUT UP THE TOMATOES.

167
00:06:29,139 --> 00:06:31,766
ARE THEY, UH, FIRM?

168
00:06:33,185 --> 00:06:34,769
THEY'RE ALL RIGHT.

169
00:06:34,811 --> 00:06:37,272
YOU SURE
THEY HAVEN'T GONE BAD?

170
00:06:37,314 --> 00:06:39,774
YOU SURE THEY'RE NOT
VERY, VERY BAD?

171
00:06:43,486 --> 00:06:45,197
NO, REALLY, THEY'RE OKAY.

172
00:06:45,239 --> 00:06:47,574
YOU GOING TO SLICE THEM UP
REAL NICE?

173
00:06:47,615 --> 00:06:49,743
ACTUALLY, I WAS GOING
TO DO THEM JULIENNE.

174
00:06:49,784 --> 00:06:52,079
( moaning )

175
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,830
I'M OUT OF HERE.

176
00:06:53,872 --> 00:06:55,414
MONICA, I'M QUITTING.

177
00:06:55,456 --> 00:06:57,876
I JUST HELPED AN 81-YEAR-OLD
WOMAN PUT ON A THONG

178
00:06:57,918 --> 00:06:59,418
AND SHE DIDN'T EVEN BUY IT.

179
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:01,213
I'M TELLING YOU, I'M QUITTING.

180
00:07:01,255 --> 00:07:03,464
THAT'S IT. I'M TALKING
TO MY BOSS RIGHT NOW.

181
00:07:03,506 --> 00:07:04,465
YES, I AM.

182
00:07:04,507 --> 00:07:05,717
YES, I AM. YES, I AM.

183
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:07,219
YES, I AM. YES, I AM.
YES, I AM.

184
00:07:07,261 --> 00:07:09,263
OKAY, BYE. CALL ME
WHEN YOU GET THIS MESSAGE.

185
00:07:09,304 --> 00:07:10,430
WHAT HAPPENED?

186
00:07:10,471 --> 00:07:12,266
WELL, HE CAME IN
FOR A MASSAGE...

187
00:07:12,307 --> 00:07:14,142
AND EVERYTHING
WAS FINE UNTIL...

188
00:07:18,563 --> 00:07:20,357
OH...
OH...
OH, MY GOD.

189
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:24,861
AND ALL OF A SUDDEN, HIS HANDS
WEREN'T THE PROBLEM ANYMORE.

190
00:07:27,989 --> 00:07:29,448
WAS IT...

191
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:33,287
OH, BOY SCOUTS COULD
HAVE CAMPED UNDER THERE.

192
00:07:33,328 --> 00:07:35,038
YOU ATE MY SANDWICH?

193
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,373
IT WAS A SIMPLE MISTAKE.

194
00:07:36,415 --> 00:07:37,791
IT COULD HAPPEN TO ANYONE.

195
00:07:37,832 --> 00:07:40,127
OH, REAL-REALLY?

196
00:07:40,168 --> 00:07:41,795
NOW, NOW, CALM DOWN.

197
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:43,213
COME LOOK IN MY OFFICE.

198
00:07:43,255 --> 00:07:45,506
SOME OF IT MAY STILL
BE IN THE TRASH.

199
00:07:46,967 --> 00:07:48,760
WHAT?

200
00:07:48,802 --> 00:07:50,469
WELL, IT WAS QUITE LARGE.

201
00:07:50,511 --> 00:07:52,513
I HAD TO THROW
MOST OF IT AWAY.

202
00:07:52,555 --> 00:07:54,515
YOU... YOU... YOU...

203
00:07:54,557 --> 00:07:58,145
YOU THREW MY SANDWICH AWAY?

204
00:07:58,186 --> 00:08:00,230
MY SANDWICH?!

205
00:08:00,272 --> 00:08:03,691
( voice echoing ):
MY SANDWICH?!

206
00:08:03,733 --> 00:08:07,404
I WANT THIS PART
SO MUCH, YOU KNOW.

207
00:08:07,446 --> 00:08:08,905
IF I DON'T GET THIS PART

208
00:08:08,947 --> 00:08:11,325
I'M NEVER GOING TO EAT
MACARONI AND CHEESE AGAIN.

209
00:08:11,366 --> 00:08:13,618
NO, I DIDN'T SAY THAT.
THAT DOESN'T COUNT.

210
00:08:18,498 --> 00:08:21,418
OH, COME ON, GUYS,
IT'S NOT LIKE I MOVED TO EUROPE.

211
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:24,087
I JUST MOVED ACROSS THE HALL.

212
00:08:24,129 --> 00:08:27,341
AND WE WOULD HAVE YOU OVER
ALL THE TIME

213
00:08:27,382 --> 00:08:30,510
IF IT WEREN'T FOR
MONICA'S ALLERGIES.

214
00:08:30,551 --> 00:08:31,510
( quacks )

215
00:08:31,552 --> 00:08:32,595
YOU'RE RIGHT.

216
00:08:32,637 --> 00:08:34,555
I COULD NEVER LIE TO YOU.

217
00:08:34,597 --> 00:08:36,350
SHE HATES YOU.

218
00:08:36,391 --> 00:08:38,352
( phone ringing )

219
00:08:38,393 --> 00:08:40,479
SHOULD I GET THAT?

220
00:08:41,771 --> 00:08:43,606
HELLO.

221
00:08:43,648 --> 00:08:45,692
UH, NO, JOEY'S
NOT HERE RIGHT NOW.

222
00:08:45,733 --> 00:08:47,526
CAN I TAKE A MESSAGE?

223
00:08:47,568 --> 00:08:51,114
YEAH, OKAY, SO THE AUDITION'S
BEEN MOVED FROM 5:00 TO 2:30.

224
00:08:51,156 --> 00:08:53,908
OKAY, GREAT. BYE.

225
00:09:00,081 --> 00:09:01,875
( gasps )

226
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:03,877
AREN'T YOU DRESSED YET?

227
00:09:03,918 --> 00:09:07,005
AM I NAKED AGAIN?

228
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:10,550
WE'RE SUPPOSED TO MEET
MY PARENTS IN 15 MINUTES.

229
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:12,469
YEAH, OKAY, I WAS JUST
TALKING TO THE GUYS.

230
00:09:12,511 --> 00:09:13,678
LOOK AT THEM.

231
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,805
I MEAN, IS IT OKAY
IF THEY COME VISIT?

232
00:09:15,847 --> 00:09:17,516
WHAT ABOUT MY ALLERGIES?

233
00:09:17,557 --> 00:09:19,767
OH, RIGHT.

234
00:09:19,809 --> 00:09:21,269
YOUR ALLERGIES.

235
00:09:22,603 --> 00:09:25,106
ALL HER. SHE HATES YOU.

236
00:09:35,534 --> 00:09:37,452
OH, OH, OH,
OH, OH, OH.

237
00:09:37,494 --> 00:09:39,496
YES! HA-HA-HA!

238
00:09:40,997 --> 00:09:42,707
HEY, HOW COOL WOULD IT BE

239
00:09:42,749 --> 00:09:45,377
IF YOU COULD WATCH, LIKE, A REAL
LIFE-SIZED VERSION OF THIS, HUH?

240
00:09:45,419 --> 00:09:46,920
I MEAN, HOW CRAZY
WOULD THAT BE?

241
00:09:46,961 --> 00:09:49,381
AS CRAZY AS SOCCER?

242
00:09:49,423 --> 00:09:51,049
( phone ringing )

243
00:09:53,634 --> 00:09:55,095
HELLO.

244
00:09:55,136 --> 00:09:56,555
WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?

245
00:09:56,596 --> 00:09:58,181
THE AUDITION'S NOT TILL 5:00.

246
00:10:01,142 --> 00:10:03,686
WELL, NOBODY
TOLD ME.

247
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:06,064
WHO'D YOU TALK TO?

248
00:10:10,193 --> 00:10:12,195
NEVER MIND.

249
00:10:12,237 --> 00:10:15,574
YOU MEAN, YOU DIDN'T
GET IT FROM THIS?

250
00:10:15,615 --> 00:10:18,285
THE ALLERGY GUY GOT THE PART.
THANKS.

251
00:10:18,326 --> 00:10:20,745
WELL, MAYBE WE CAN
FIX IT, YOU KNOW.

252
00:10:20,787 --> 00:10:24,791
MAYBE WE CAN SEND HIM SOME, SOME
BIG, BIG FLOWERS AND SCARE HIM.

253
00:10:24,832 --> 00:10:26,626
HOW COULD YOU DO THIS
TO ME, CHANDLER?

254
00:10:26,667 --> 00:10:29,129
THIS PART COULD HAVE TURNED
MY WHOLE CAREER AROUND.

255
00:10:29,170 --> 00:10:30,964
I MESSED UP, OKAY?

256
00:10:31,005 --> 00:10:32,715
I'M SORRY.
I REALLY MESSED UP.

257
00:10:32,757 --> 00:10:34,342
YOU DON'T EVEN
LIVE HERE ANYMORE.

258
00:10:34,384 --> 00:10:36,177
WHY ANSWER MY PHONE?
I HAVE A MACHINE.

259
00:10:36,219 --> 00:10:37,554
WHICH I BOUGHT FOR YOU.

260
00:10:39,055 --> 00:10:40,681
TAUGHT YOU HOW TO USE IT.

261
00:10:40,723 --> 00:10:42,601
YOU THOUGHT IT WAS A COPIER.

262
00:10:44,269 --> 00:10:46,938
LOOK, IF THERE WAS ANYTHING
I COULD DO, I WOULD DO IT, OKAY?

263
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:48,856
BUT EVERYBODY'S ALLOWED
ONE MISTAKE, RIGHT?

264
00:10:49,941 --> 00:10:51,692
YOU KNOW, HE COULD
HAVE GOT ME A VCR

265
00:10:51,734 --> 00:10:53,069
OR A SET OF GOLF CLUBS.

266
00:10:53,111 --> 00:10:55,155
BUT, NO, HE HAS TO GET ME
THE WOMAN REPELLER.

267
00:10:56,739 --> 00:10:59,242
THE EYESORE FROM THE LIBERACE
HOUSE OF CRAP!

268
00:10:59,284 --> 00:11:00,327
NOT THAT BAD.

269
00:11:00,368 --> 00:11:01,828
OH, YEAH, EASY
FOR YOU TO DAY.

270
00:11:01,869 --> 00:11:03,371
YOU DON'T HAVE
TO WALK AROUND

271
00:11:03,413 --> 00:11:05,665
SPOTTING SOME REJECT
FROM THE MR. T COLLECTION.

272
00:11:05,706 --> 00:11:07,083
CHANDLER, CHANDLER...

273
00:11:07,125 --> 00:11:09,419
I PITY THE FOOL
WHO PUTS ON MY JEWELRY.

274
00:11:09,461 --> 00:11:11,421
I DO! I DO!
I PITY THE FOOL

275
00:11:11,463 --> 00:11:13,047
IF I...

276
00:11:14,633 --> 00:11:18,677
WHEN YOU WERE LATE LAST NIGHT,
KATHY AND I GOT TO TALKING

277
00:11:18,719 --> 00:11:21,473
AND... ONE THING LED TO ANOTHER,
AND...

278
00:11:21,515 --> 00:11:22,849
AND WHAT?

279
00:11:22,890 --> 00:11:24,142
DID YOU SLEEP WITH HER?

280
00:11:24,184 --> 00:11:25,977
NO, NO, NO.
I JUST KISSED HER.

281
00:11:26,019 --> 00:11:28,229
WHAT?! THAT'S EVEN WORSE!

282
00:11:28,271 --> 00:11:29,772
HOW IS THAT WORSE?

283
00:11:29,814 --> 00:11:31,774
I DON'T KNOW,
BUT IT'S THE SAME.

284
00:11:31,816 --> 00:11:33,692
YOU'RE RIGHT.
I HAVE NO EXCUSES.

285
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:35,362
I WAS TOTALLY
OVER THE LINE.

286
00:11:35,403 --> 00:11:36,488
OVER THE LINE?

287
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:38,156
YOU'RE SO FAR PAST THE LINE

288
00:11:38,198 --> 00:11:40,200
THAT YOU CAN'T EVEN
SEE THE LINE.

289
00:11:40,241 --> 00:11:41,868
THE LINE IS A DOT TO YOU.

290
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:44,287
LOOK, I'M NOT SAYING

291
00:11:44,329 --> 00:11:46,164
YOU SHOULD MAGICALLY
FORGIVE ME

292
00:11:46,206 --> 00:11:47,457
BUT YOU'RE NOT PERFECT.

293
00:11:47,499 --> 00:11:49,708
YOU'VE MADE SOME ERRORS
IN JUDGMENT, TOO.

294
00:11:49,750 --> 00:11:51,085
NAME ONE.

295
00:11:52,337 --> 00:11:53,796
WHAT HAPPENED?

296
00:11:53,838 --> 00:11:58,635
OH, MAN! HE PROMISED
HE WOULDN'T TAKE THE CHAIRS.

297
00:11:58,677 --> 00:11:59,969
WHAT THE HELL HAPPENED?

298
00:12:00,011 --> 00:12:01,221
HOW WERE YOU LOCKED IN

299
00:12:01,262 --> 00:12:03,722
AND WHERE THE HELL'S
ALL OF OUR STUFF?

300
00:12:03,764 --> 00:12:05,808
WELL, THIS GUY CAME BY
TO LOOK AT THE UNIT

301
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,227
AND HE SAID HE DIDN'T THINK

302
00:12:07,268 --> 00:12:09,145
IT WAS BIG ENOUGH
TO FIT A GROWN MAN.

303
00:12:09,187 --> 00:12:12,440
SO... YOU GOT
IN VOLUNTARILY?

304
00:12:12,482 --> 00:12:14,775
I WAS TRYING
TO MAKE A SALE.

305
00:12:14,817 --> 00:12:17,362
OH, MAN. IF I EVER RUN
INTO THAT GUY AGAIN

306
00:12:17,404 --> 00:12:18,821
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M GOING TO DO?

307
00:12:18,863 --> 00:12:19,864
BEND OVER?

308
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:22,409
THERE'S LORRAINE.

309
00:12:22,450 --> 00:12:23,826
OKAY, NOW, REMEMBER--

310
00:12:23,868 --> 00:12:25,119
NO TRADING.

311
00:12:25,161 --> 00:12:27,372
YOU GET THE PRETTY ONE,
I GET THE MESS.

312
00:12:27,414 --> 00:12:28,831
HI, JOEY.

313
00:12:28,873 --> 00:12:29,874
HEY.

314
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:35,714
WELL, WELL,
LOOK WHAT YOU BROUGHT.

315
00:12:35,754 --> 00:12:38,049
AND WHAT DID YOU BRING?

316
00:12:38,091 --> 00:12:39,967
SHE'S CHECKING HER COAT.

317
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:44,180
JOEY, I'M GOING TO GO WASH
THE CAB SMELL OFF MY HANDS.

318
00:12:44,222 --> 00:12:46,641
WILL YOU GET ME
A WHITE ZINFANDEL

319
00:12:46,683 --> 00:12:49,018
AND A GLASS OF RED
FOR JANICE.

320
00:12:53,648 --> 00:12:54,815
JANICE?

321
00:12:56,568 --> 00:12:58,777
JANICE?

322
00:12:58,819 --> 00:13:04,367
OH... MY... GOD.

323
00:13:04,409 --> 00:13:05,868
JOEY'S TAILOR...

324
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:07,746
TOOK ADVANTAGE OF ME.

325
00:13:07,786 --> 00:13:09,748
WHAT?

326
00:13:09,788 --> 00:13:11,291
NO WAY.

327
00:13:11,332 --> 00:13:13,418
I'VE BEEN GOING TO THE GUY
FOR 12 YEARS.

328
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:15,794
OH, COME ON. HE SAID
HE WAS GOING TO DO MY INSEAM.

329
00:13:15,836 --> 00:13:17,796
THEN HE RAN HIS HAND
UP MY LEG

330
00:13:17,838 --> 00:13:19,882
AND THEN,
THERE WAS DEFINITE...

331
00:13:19,924 --> 00:13:20,967
WHAT?

332
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:22,218
CUPPING.

333
00:13:25,263 --> 00:13:29,058
THAT'S HOW THEY DO PANTS.

334
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:30,393
ROSS, WILL YOU
TELL HIM?

335
00:13:30,435 --> 00:13:32,853
ISN'T THAT HOW A TAILOR
MEASURES PANTS?

336
00:13:32,895 --> 00:13:35,148
YES, YES, IT IS-- IN PRISON!

337
00:13:38,817 --> 00:13:40,987
I SAID, "NAME ONE."

338
00:13:44,157 --> 00:13:45,199
( door shuts )

339
00:13:47,868 --> 00:13:48,953
I CAN'T BELIEVE
I DID THIS.

340
00:13:48,995 --> 00:13:49,954
WHAT AN IDIOT.

341
00:13:49,996 --> 00:13:51,914
OH, STOP BEATING
YOURSELF UP.

342
00:13:51,956 --> 00:13:53,541
PEOPLE MAKE MISTAKES.

343
00:13:53,583 --> 00:13:55,168
THESE THINGS HAPPEN.

344
00:13:55,209 --> 00:13:57,754
THERE AREN'T
ANY MESSAGES

345
00:13:57,796 --> 00:14:00,173
THAT YOU'VE FORGOTTEN
TO GIVE ME, ARE THERE?

346
00:14:00,214 --> 00:14:02,883
WELL, APPARENTLY,
YOU'RE NOT VERY GOOD AT IT.

347
00:14:02,925 --> 00:14:05,011
DO YOU THINK HE'LL
EVER FORGIVE ME?

348
00:14:05,052 --> 00:14:06,721
OF COURSE HE WILL,
BUT, CHANDLER

349
00:14:06,763 --> 00:14:09,056
THE MOST IMPORTANT THING IS
THAT YOU FORGIVE YOURSELF.

350
00:14:09,098 --> 00:14:10,099
YOU KNOW WHAT?

351
00:14:10,141 --> 00:14:11,309
I KIND OF HAVE.

352
00:14:11,351 --> 00:14:12,602
ALREADY?

353
00:14:12,644 --> 00:14:14,729
THAT WAS PRETTY BAD,
WHAT YOU DID.

354
00:14:14,771 --> 00:14:15,730
OH, YOU KNOW WHAT?

355
00:14:15,772 --> 00:14:16,897
HE WILL FORGIVE YOU

356
00:14:16,939 --> 00:14:18,733
AND I LIKE TO BRING
A PAD WITH ME

357
00:14:18,775 --> 00:14:21,152
WHEN I GO ANSWER THE PHONE,
JUST IN CASE.

358
00:14:21,194 --> 00:14:22,403
OKAY.

359
00:14:22,445 --> 00:14:24,531
YOU DIDN'T SEE HOW
MAD HE WAS, YOU KNOW?

360
00:14:24,572 --> 00:14:26,073
I'M SURE HE WILL FORGIVE YOU.

361
00:14:26,115 --> 00:14:27,492
LOOK, WE'VE ALL BEEN THERE.

362
00:14:27,534 --> 00:14:29,243
YOU KNOW, YOU FIGHT;
YOU MAKE UP--

363
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:30,870
THAT'S JUST THE WAY IT WORKS.

364
00:14:30,911 --> 00:14:32,330
IT TOOK TWO PEOPLE

365
00:14:32,372 --> 00:14:34,749
TO BREAK UP
THIS RELATIONSHIP.

366
00:14:34,791 --> 00:14:36,835
YEAH, YOU AND THAT GIRL
FROM THE COPY PLACE

367
00:14:36,876 --> 00:14:39,337
WHICH, YESTERDAY, YOU TOOK
FULL RESPONSIBILITY FOR.

368
00:14:39,379 --> 00:14:40,714
I DIDN'T KNOW
WHAT I WAS

369
00:14:40,755 --> 00:14:42,590
TAKING RESPONSIBILITY
FOR, OKAY?

370
00:14:42,632 --> 00:14:44,384
I DIDN'T FINISH
THE WHOLE LETTER.

371
00:14:44,425 --> 00:14:45,009
WHAT?

372
00:14:45,051 --> 00:14:46,260
I FELL ASLEEP.

373
00:14:46,302 --> 00:14:48,929
YOU FELL ASLEEP?

374
00:14:48,971 --> 00:14:51,766
IT WAS 5:30
IN THE MORNING

375
00:14:51,808 --> 00:14:56,771
AND YOU HAD RAMBLED
ON FOR 18 PAGES.

376
00:14:58,356 --> 00:15:00,692
FRONT AND BACK!

377
00:15:00,734 --> 00:15:01,860
( groans )

378
00:15:01,901 --> 00:15:03,653
OH-OH-OH, AND BY THE WAY

379
00:15:03,695 --> 00:15:05,988
Y-O-U APOSTROPHE R-E

380
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,448
MEANS "YOU ARE."

381
00:15:07,490 --> 00:15:09,325
Y-O-U-R MEANS "YOUR."

382
00:15:09,367 --> 00:15:10,951
HA! YOU KNOW,
I CAN'T BELIEVE

383
00:15:10,993 --> 00:15:13,830
I EVEN THOUGHT OF GETTING
BACK TOGETHER WITH YOU.

384
00:15:13,872 --> 00:15:15,289
WE ARE SO OVER.

385
00:15:15,331 --> 00:15:17,124
( choked up ):
OH... OH... OH...

386
00:15:17,166 --> 00:15:18,459
FINE BY ME!

387
00:15:18,501 --> 00:15:21,713
AND HEY, JUST SO YOU KNOW...

388
00:15:21,755 --> 00:15:23,047
IT'S NOT THAT COMMON

389
00:15:23,089 --> 00:15:25,132
IT DOESN'T HAPPEN TO EVERY GUY

390
00:15:25,174 --> 00:15:27,552
AND IT IS A BIG DEAL!

391
00:15:27,594 --> 00:15:30,971
I KNEW IT!

392
00:15:31,013 --> 00:15:32,766
YOU HAD NO RIGHT
TO GO OUT WITH HIM.

393
00:15:32,807 --> 00:15:34,559
THAT IS THE MOST
RIDICULOUS...

394
00:15:34,601 --> 00:15:36,060
YOU SOLD ME OUT!

395
00:15:36,102 --> 00:15:37,019
I DID NOT!

396
00:15:37,061 --> 00:15:38,062
YES, YOU DID!

397
00:15:38,104 --> 00:15:40,022
WOULD YOU
LET ME TALK?!

398
00:15:42,901 --> 00:15:44,903
DID YOU JUST FLICK ME?

399
00:15:44,944 --> 00:15:47,614
OKAY, WELL,
YOU WOULDN'T
LET ME FINISH

400
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:48,782
AND I WAS JUST...

401
00:15:48,823 --> 00:15:50,491
OW! THAT HURT! OW!

402
00:15:52,577 --> 00:15:53,870
OH! ALL RIGHT. OKAY.

403
00:15:53,912 --> 00:15:55,663
LET'S NOT DO THIS!
LET'S NOT DO THIS!

404
00:15:55,705 --> 00:15:57,998
( shrieking )

405
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,083
HAPPY THOUGHTS!

406
00:15:59,125 --> 00:16:00,668
HAPPY THOUGHTS!

407
00:16:00,710 --> 00:16:01,795
NO! NO!

408
00:16:01,836 --> 00:16:02,796
Rachel:
STOP IT!

409
00:16:02,837 --> 00:16:04,338
OH! OH!

410
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:06,257
NOW I'M GOING TO KICK SOME ASS!

411
00:16:08,468 --> 00:16:09,427
OW!

412
00:16:09,469 --> 00:16:10,845
OW!

413
00:16:10,887 --> 00:16:12,764
OW! OW! OW!
OW! OW! OW!

414
00:16:12,806 --> 00:16:14,432
OW! OW! OW!
OW! OW! OW!

415
00:16:14,474 --> 00:16:15,934
ALL RIGHT.

416
00:16:15,974 --> 00:16:19,103
NOW, I WILL LET GO
IF YOU BOTH STOP.

417
00:16:19,145 --> 00:16:21,230
FINE.

418
00:16:21,272 --> 00:16:22,523
FINE.

419
00:16:22,565 --> 00:16:23,900
THERE WE GO.

420
00:16:23,942 --> 00:16:25,234
YOU KNOW WHAT?

421
00:16:25,276 --> 00:16:26,569
IF WE WERE IN PRISON

422
00:16:26,611 --> 00:16:29,029
YOU GUYS WOULD BE,
LIKE, MY BITCHES.

423
00:16:37,204 --> 00:16:39,874
OKAY, BUDDY BOY, HERE IT IS.

424
00:16:39,916 --> 00:16:44,963
YOU HIDE MY CLOTHES,
I'M WEARING EVERYTHING YOU OWN.

425
00:16:45,003 --> 00:16:47,423
OH, MY GOD!

426
00:16:47,465 --> 00:16:48,758
LOOK AT ME!

427
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,050
I'M CHANDLER!

428
00:16:50,092 --> 00:16:51,302
COULD I BE WEARING

429
00:16:51,344 --> 00:16:53,680
ANY MORE CLOTHES?

430
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:56,307
MAYBE IF I
WASN'T GOING COMMANDO...

431
00:16:56,349 --> 00:16:59,352
( choked groaning )

432
00:16:59,393 --> 00:17:02,396
WHOO! I TELL YOU, IT'S HOT
WITH ALL THIS STUFF ON.

433
00:17:02,438 --> 00:17:05,358
I... I BETTER NOT DO ANY,
I DON'T KNOW, LUNGES.

434
00:17:08,027 --> 00:17:11,155
♪ LIVIN' ALONE ♪

435
00:17:11,197 --> 00:17:15,033
♪ I THINK OF ALL THE FRIENDS
I'VE KNOWN ♪

436
00:17:17,537 --> 00:17:21,040
♪ BUT WHEN I DIAL
THE TELEPHONE ♪

437
00:17:22,917 --> 00:17:25,545
♪ NOBODY'S HOME ♪

438
00:17:33,887 --> 00:17:40,351
♪ ALL BY MYSELF ♪

439
00:17:40,393 --> 00:17:42,353
♪ DON'T WANNA LIVE ♪

440
00:17:42,395 --> 00:17:47,274
♪ ALL BY MYSELF ♪

441
00:17:47,316 --> 00:17:49,151
♪ ANYMORE ♪

442
00:17:50,653 --> 00:17:56,993
♪ ALL BY MYSELF... ♪

443
00:17:57,035 --> 00:17:59,495
JOEY...

444
00:17:59,537 --> 00:18:01,789
GOT YOU THE JOEY SPECIAL--

445
00:18:01,831 --> 00:18:03,833
TWO PIZZAS.

446
00:18:03,875 --> 00:18:04,834
JOE?

447
00:18:04,876 --> 00:18:06,210
( phone ringing )

448
00:18:07,378 --> 00:18:08,838
HELLO.

449
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,048
DAMN IT!

450
00:18:11,883 --> 00:18:13,175
HELLO.

451
00:18:13,217 --> 00:18:15,219
NO, JOEY'S NOT HERE RIGHT NOW

452
00:18:15,261 --> 00:18:17,722
BUT I CAN TAKE A MESSAGE...
I THINK.

453
00:18:17,764 --> 00:18:20,058
HE'S STILL GOT A CHANCE
FOR THE PART?

454
00:18:20,099 --> 00:18:21,517
OH, THAT'S GREAT NEWS!

455
00:18:21,559 --> 00:18:23,895
WELL, NO,
OBVIOUSLY NOT FOR THE ACTOR

456
00:18:23,937 --> 00:18:25,605
WHO WAS MAULED BY HIS DOG.

457
00:18:25,646 --> 00:18:27,147
OH, WELL, THAT'S GREAT.

458
00:18:27,189 --> 00:18:29,025
I WILL GIVE JOEY THE MESSAGE.

459
00:18:29,067 --> 00:18:30,026
THANK YOU.

460
00:18:30,068 --> 00:18:32,528
YES!

461
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:37,491
OKAY... MAC AUDITION

462
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:41,537
AT 2:00...

463
00:18:41,579 --> 00:18:47,543
ALLERGY ACTOR ATTACKED...

464
00:18:52,882 --> 00:18:55,509
BY DOG

465
00:18:55,551 --> 00:19:00,098
NOT FLOWERS.

466
00:19:01,181 --> 00:19:02,182
OKAY.

467
00:19:06,437 --> 00:19:07,563
HEY.

468
00:19:07,605 --> 00:19:10,232
PLEASE TELL ME
YOU GOT THE MESSAGE.

469
00:19:10,274 --> 00:19:11,525
WHAT MESSAGE?

470
00:19:11,567 --> 00:19:13,235
THE ACTOR PLAYING MAC
COULDN'T DO IT.

471
00:19:13,277 --> 00:19:14,988
THEY NEEDED TO SEE YOU AT 2:00.

472
00:19:15,029 --> 00:19:15,989
WHAT?

473
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:17,448
IT'S 6:00.

474
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,033
( stammering ):
I WROTE IT ON THE BOARD!

475
00:19:19,075 --> 00:19:20,242
I WROTE IT ON THE BOARD

476
00:19:20,284 --> 00:19:21,828
AND THEN I WENT ALL
OVER NEW YORK CITY

477
00:19:21,869 --> 00:19:22,829
LOOKING FOR YOU.

478
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:23,830
I WENT TO ROSS'S.

479
00:19:23,871 --> 00:19:25,331
I WENT TO THE COFFEEHOUSE.

480
00:19:25,372 --> 00:19:27,207
I WENT TO ANYPLACE
THAT THEY MAKE SANDWICHES.

481
00:19:27,249 --> 00:19:30,086
I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS, CHANDLER.

482
00:19:30,128 --> 00:19:31,169
I'M SORRY.

483
00:19:31,211 --> 00:19:33,255
I-I-I-I DON'T
KNOW WHAT TO SAY.

484
00:19:33,297 --> 00:19:35,091
WELL, Y-YOU MIGHT SAY...

485
00:19:35,133 --> 00:19:36,550
"CONGRATULATIONS."

486
00:19:36,592 --> 00:19:37,718
I SAW THE BOARD.

487
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:39,887
I WENT TO THE AUDITION.

488
00:19:39,929 --> 00:19:41,055
I GOT THE PART!

489
00:19:41,097 --> 00:19:42,598
IS THAT SUPPOSED TO BE FUNNY?

490
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,350
I WAS REALLY WORRIED OVER HERE.

491
00:19:44,391 --> 00:19:46,060
OH, WELL, I'M SORRY.

492
00:19:46,102 --> 00:19:47,812
SOMETIMES THAT FAKE-
OUT THING IS MEAN.

493
00:19:47,854 --> 00:19:49,522
OH, WOW, OKAY, MAN, I'M SORRY.

494
00:19:49,563 --> 00:19:51,565
I DID NOT MEAN
TO MAKE YOU FEEL BAD.

495
00:19:51,607 --> 00:19:52,817
WELL, THAT'S GOOD...

496
00:19:52,859 --> 00:19:54,152
BECAUSE YOU DIDN'T...

497
00:19:54,193 --> 00:19:56,236
AND I'M INCREDIBLY
HAPPY FOR YOU.

498
00:19:56,278 --> 00:19:58,531
THAT'S MEAN!

499
00:19:58,572 --> 00:20:00,116
YOU REALLY

500
00:20:00,158 --> 00:20:01,408
HAD ME GOING THERE.

501
00:20:01,450 --> 00:20:02,952
OH, WE COULD DO
THIS ALL DAY.

502
00:20:02,994 --> 00:20:04,203
YEAH, YOU'RE RIGHT.

503
00:20:04,244 --> 00:20:05,997
OKAY, LOOK,
LET'S TALK

504
00:20:06,039 --> 00:20:08,124
ABOUT WHAT A HUGE STAR
I'M GOING TO BE.

505
00:20:08,166 --> 00:20:09,500
YOU ARE GOING TO
BE A HUGE STAR.

506
00:20:09,542 --> 00:20:10,501
I'M GOING TO HUG YOU.

507
00:20:10,543 --> 00:20:11,502
YOU HUG ME.

508
00:20:11,544 --> 00:20:13,087
ALL RIGHT.

509
00:20:40,656 --> 00:20:42,700
HEY, DO WE DO
THIS TOO MUCH?

510
00:20:42,742 --> 00:20:43,993
I THINK SO.

511
00:20:44,035 --> 00:20:45,285
YEAH, GET OFF ME.
YEAH.

512
00:20:54,587 --> 00:20:56,089
"COME ON, CHEESE.

513
00:20:56,130 --> 00:20:57,297
"I'M NOT LEAVING
WITHOUT YOU.

514
00:20:57,339 --> 00:20:59,050
"TRY ROUTING YOUR
BACKUP POWER SOURCE

515
00:20:59,092 --> 00:21:00,426
THROUGH YOUR
PRIMARY C.P.U."

516
00:21:00,467 --> 00:21:01,427
"I CAN'T.

517
00:21:01,468 --> 00:21:03,096
"MY CIRCUITS ARE FRIED.

518
00:21:03,137 --> 00:21:05,014
THEY'RE FRIED,
I TELL YOU!"

519
00:21:06,891 --> 00:21:08,517
WOW.

520
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:11,187
"WELL, THEN, I'LL JUST
HAVE TO CARRY YOU."

521
00:21:11,229 --> 00:21:14,356
"THAT'LL BE A NEAT
TRICK, WHEN YOU'RE...

522
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:16,067
WHEN YOU'RE DEAD!"

523
00:21:17,359 --> 00:21:19,987
ROSS, YOU DON'T
HAVE TO YELL.

524
00:21:20,029 --> 00:21:22,322
THERE WAS JUST AN EXPLOSION,
OKAY?

525
00:21:22,364 --> 00:21:24,324
MY HEARING WOULD BE IMPAIRED.

526
00:21:24,366 --> 00:21:26,119
I THOUGHT
YOU WERE EXCELLENT.

527
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:27,787
IN FACT,
FOR A MINUTE THERE

528
00:21:27,828 --> 00:21:29,997
I WAS, LIKE,
"OOH, WHERE'D ROSS GO?"

529
00:21:30,039 --> 00:21:31,665
THANK YOU

530
00:21:31,707 --> 00:21:33,709
AND I HAVE TO SAY,
THAT FIRST SCENE

531
00:21:33,751 --> 00:21:35,211
WHERE YOU MEET MAC...

532
00:21:35,253 --> 00:21:36,212
OH, MY GOD.

533
00:21:36,254 --> 00:21:37,171
I MEAN...

534
00:21:37,213 --> 00:21:38,338
OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

535
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:40,174
I THINK
THAT'S ENOUGH FOR TODAY.

536
00:21:40,216 --> 00:21:42,342
THANKS FOR YOUR HELP.

537
00:21:42,384 --> 00:21:43,636
[Captioned by
The Caption Center
WGBH Educational Foundation]

538
00:21:43,677 --> 00:21:45,096
HOLDING US BACK.

539
00:21:45,138 --> 00:21:47,389
TOTALLY.

